{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41675","headline":"题豫章西山香城寺 · 陈陶","name":"题豫章西山香城寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十地严宫礼竺皇，栴檀楼阁半天香。\n只园树老梵声小，雪岭花香灯影长。\n霄汉落泉供月界，蓬壶灵鸟侍云房。\n何年七七金人降，金锡珠坛满上方。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41675.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41675","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}